{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-08", "pageid": 119383, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-07\" title=\"灵魂影映-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E7.BA.A2.E8.AA.93.E8.A8.80\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血红誓言\">血红誓言</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 血红誓言</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">By Blood I Swear</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当月光洒满坟地，一队驻军向墓园行进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>今晚，无论你们看到什么，都不要动摇，那些全部都只是影子而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>记住！影子是没有实体的，掉不了你们一根头发！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>那只是一个狡猾的小鬼，弄不出什么名堂，听懂了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官低声传达着命令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整座城镇流传着墓园之中“死者复生”的传闻。这墓园一片死寂，即使有月光洒落，也显得幽暗阴森。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——这传闻对于手上沾满鲜血的人来说，不是一个好消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>今天一定要抓住她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>就算不能活抓她，也不能让她活着离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官神情阴狠，咬牙切齿道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声笛声打破了寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>她来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>都不要慌！找声音的方向，把她给我找出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>啊……啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笛声渐近，士兵们尝试找声音的来源，眼前却出现了更可怖的场景。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>借着月光，墓园之中腾升起影子，像快速生长的树木一般，高大而密集，渐渐笼罩了地上的士兵们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直达天际。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>都冷静！别开枪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官的声音淹没在一片恐惧的叫喊声中。看到眼前的景象，他脸色一变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>巨大的影子与月光相互侵蚀着，快速地压至侵略者的眼前，它们不断变幻着形状，墓园变成了黑色的地狱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这地狱重新上演了他们践踏生命的景象，无比巨大，无比真实。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2\"><img alt=\"3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/600px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/900px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_at_yeshumeimuyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>啊！啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>魔鬼……魔鬼！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>枪声四起，打向黑色的巨影，然而子弹无法消灭地狱。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_gongmu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_gongmu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>不要开枪！那些影子只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-638220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你们无法成为血食怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>军官听见那个血食怪的声音，在一片混乱之中，他掏出枪，却难以对准。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>你们只会在恐惧之中死去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>月光会灼烧你们的身体，黑暗会吞噬你们的灵魂，你们死后也会不得安宁……永远遭受血食怪的惩罚与折磨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-638201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>……我发誓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军军官：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>愤怒与恐惧使他不得不开枪，直到将所有子弹打尽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一片寂静，只有影子们立在墓园之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>呼……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"527001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"527001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-527001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-527001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">驻军士兵Ⅱ：</div><div>怎、怎么回事……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在“地狱”之中，他们似乎听到凄厉的哭声与惨叫，现在又回归死寂。士兵们气喘吁吁地举着枪，再次寻找异响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只有呜呜的风声。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>就这样，伟大的血食怪野树莓终于和她的家人们团聚了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>他们还拥有了更多的伙伴，他们一起守护着属于他们的土地，谁也无法再进犯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>当她的家乡归于和平宁静时，野树莓深感还有更远大的使命在召唤她，于是她再次踏上了旅途……<br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员女孩坐在她的身边，眼睛闪闪发亮，为野树莓一世的故事而惊叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这真是一个跌宕起伏的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>作为故事的主角，野树莓一世既聪明又勇敢，还有百折不挠的精神，她真是一个了不起的血食怪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她真心实意地夸赞着，美好的词汇堆叠不断，令讲述故事的人微微红了脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你、你说得也没有错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>野树莓一世过去的故事也讲完了，下次……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>下次讲什么好呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她略显烦恼，将羽毛笔放在自己的鼻子下，努了努嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>那就该讲野树莓一世现在的故事了呀！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>嗯？现在的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>野树莓一世的冒险不是还在继续吗？她肯定有了很多新的故事可以讲！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她笑眯眯地说道，声音充满包容和鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>唔，你说得也对……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>要开始讲新的故事了……对了，艾玛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将写好的信纸推给她，动作和语气都相当郑重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>这次的信，也要请你帮忙润色和批改了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>多亏了你一直帮我，我认识了很多新的单词。之前那些拼写错误，我也都改正记住了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>哼哼……你看看这次写得怎么样，有没有进步一些？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她带着很期待的神情看向与自己同龄的小小老师，等待她一如既往的鼓励和夸奖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老师却将信纸推回给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>我觉得不需要任何修改了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>这是血食怪“野树莓”的故事，是完全属于你的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>所以我觉得，保留它原本的样子就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这句话使她露出了笑容。那是一个感受到温暖之后，非常孩子气的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>唔……谢谢你，艾玛。不过伟大的血食怪野树莓的故事，最好还是不要有拼写错误……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我再来检查一下……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵敲门声响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>请进！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高大的身影走进温馨的房间里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>还没有到睡觉时间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>列车长，我们正在写信！明天到站后，可以投到车站的邮箱里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>看来我的特别培训占用了野树莓乘务员的写信时间，平时这个点你们早就睡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吓得紧贴桌面，生怕又会有一场“特别培训”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>别紧张，野树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>看来我在你心里缺乏一些人情味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从身侧拿出两件颜色不同的针织品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>我只是提前完成了这个，用来祝我的两位乘务员——圣诞快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>哇！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经验丰富的小乘务员接过那两件礼物，白色的披肩属于艾玛，红色的则属于新晋乘务员——野树莓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>快来，野树莓！这是你的～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我、我的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>列车长，你一直在织的是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当她顶着红色的毛线球怨声载道时，列车长手上编织的动作也从未停过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>员工福利，野树莓乘务员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>谢谢你，列车长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她展开红色的披肩，发现那其实是一条披风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>针织披风没有真正的披风威武，但比真正的披风更加温暖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>圣诞快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>圣诞快乐～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>圣、圣诞快乐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她很爱惜地抱着针织的红色披风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我……我再也不会倒挂在车厢里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我发誓！</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-08"}}